otengine/godot/issues/comments/3836710606","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115757#issuecomment-3836710606","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115757","id":3836710606,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kr47O","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds","html_url":"https://github.com/blueskythlikesclouds","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blueskythlikesclouds/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T17:42:42Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T17:42:42Z","body":"I'll profile tomorrow but,\r\n\r\n> This effectively brings back the CPU->CPU copy in a slightly less efficient way since we now copy element by element instead of doing one big memcpy for the entire region of the buffer that will be used.\r\n\r\nAs far as I know, on write-combined, there isn't really a difference between mass copy vs individual copy as long as all the copies are done sequentially after each other.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3836710606/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":